        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the depths of space… Your ship, guided by its own autopilot, faces endless waves of alien threats. It maneuvers on its own, dodges incoming fire, and never stops firing back. So what’s your role in this battle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.poster.avif?t=1761752015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.webm?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.mp4?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the mind behind the ship. With your deck of strategic cards, you upgrade, enhance, and transform it into a deadly war machine. Each new card unlocks an advantage—stronger shields, deadlier weapons, or faster maneuvers. Your choices decide whether the ship survives or is lost to the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.poster.avif?t=1761752015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.webm?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.mp4?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there’s your ultimate trump card: the <strong>Omega Device</strong>. A single blast from this devastating weapon can light up the darkness of space—but only you can decide when to unleash it. Use it carelessly, and you may be left defenseless against the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your typical space shooter. Instead of struggling with tricky controls, you focus purely on strategy and progression. While the ship fights automatically, you’re constantly pushing it to become stronger, faster, and tougher. Beneath the calm rhythm lies a relentless pressure: you will always need more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.poster.avif?t=1761752015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.webm?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.mp4?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself—because here, victory doesn’t belong to quick reflexes alone. It belongs to your strategy, your upgrades, and your ability to outlast the storm.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the depths of space… Your ship, guided by its own autopilot, faces endless waves of alien threats. It maneuvers on its own, dodges incoming fire, and never stops firing back. So what’s your role in this battle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.poster.avif?t=1761752015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.webm?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/243d22e457a38218e5eb6be7914dc1e7.mp4?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the mind behind the ship. With your deck of strategic cards, you upgrade, enhance, and transform it into a deadly war machine. Each new card unlocks an advantage—stronger shields, deadlier weapons, or faster maneuvers. Your choices decide whether the ship survives or is lost to the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.poster.avif?t=1761752015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.webm?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/c5c0444e86cf0bc96d7f036010f1d034.mp4?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there’s your ultimate trump card: the <strong>Omega Device</strong>. A single blast from this devastating weapon can light up the darkness of space—but only you can decide when to unleash it. Use it carelessly, and you may be left defenseless against the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your typical space shooter. Instead of struggling with tricky controls, you focus purely on strategy and progression. While the ship fights automatically, you’re constantly pushing it to become stronger, faster, and tougher. Beneath the calm rhythm lies a relentless pressure: you will always need more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.poster.avif?t=1761752015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.webm?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960770/extras/1a9368f8213f36b52bb22bd4c6cfa55f.mp4?t=1761752015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself—because here, victory doesn’t belong to quick reflexes alone. It belongs to your strategy, your upgrades, and your ability to outlast the storm.</p>",
        "short_description": "While your ship battles enemies on autopilot, your mission is to keep upgrading it with strategic cards. In this experience that values brains over reflexes, the right upgrades are the key to victory!",
